<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-VAN GOBBEL RETURNS TO FEYENOORD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VAN GOBBEL RETURNS TO FEYENOORD.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feyenoord on Friday bought back defender Ulrich van Gobbel from Southampton almost two years after selling him to the England premier league club, the Dutch news agency ANP said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 26-year-old player signed  a four-year deal with Feyenoord, runners-up in the Dutch first division last season.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed.</p>
